id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45397::$$$message_0421_0000_0000$$$::"How wonderful! So this is the legendary Japanese open-air bath!"::
45398::$$$message_0421_0000_0001$$$::"Welcome, madam. I've been waiting for you."::
45399::$$$message_0421_0000_0002$$$::"Oh, Maiya!"::
45400::$$$message_0421_0000_0003$$$::"Kiritsugu had me conduct a thorough check of the premises prior to your arrival."::
45401::$$$message_0421_0000_0004$$$::"I've cleared every nook and cranny, even the bathtubs, and found no sign of traps or ambushes. You're safe here."::
45402::$$$message_0421_0000_0005$$$::"Um... So you already took the first bath, Maiya?"::
45403::$$$message_0421_0000_0006$$$::"Is there a problem with that?"::
45404::$$$message_0421_0000_0007$$$::"...Maiya, did anything mysterious happen after you took a bath?"::
45405::$$$message_0421_0000_0008$$$::"Not particularly."::
45406::$$$message_0421_0000_0009$$$::"I did, however, find it odd that all of the three-course meals on the hotel menu were suddenly changed to cake smorgasbords."::
45407::$$$message_0421_0000_0010$$$::"..."::
45408::$$$message_0421_0000_0011$$$::"The tiramisu, strawberry sorbet, and chocolate fondue are to die for. I highly recommend them."::
45409::$$$message_0421_0000_0012$$$::"...Oh, well. At least rest and relaxation were always part of the plan.::
45410::$$$message_0421_0000_0013$$$::"Yes. It should be the ideal place to recover our fighting spirit."::
45411::$$$message_0421_0000_0014$$$::"I'm sure that the fairyland my mentor is trapped in must be a place like this."::
45412::$$$message_0421_0000_0015$$$::"By the way, where's Kiritsugu?"::
45413::$$$message_0421_0000_0016$$$::"Monitoring this onsen from his sniper's hide on Mt. Enzou. He's ready to terminate any other Master who approaches."::
45414::$$$message_0421_0000_0017$$$::"That makes him sound like a criminal, actually..."::
45415::$$$message_0421_0000_0018$$$::"It's bad manners, even if we are married... Oh, he's so hopeless. I'm sure he'll get stiff shoulders and come take a bath eventually."::
45416::$$$message_0421_0000_0019$$$::"Until then, it's a girl's night out. Let's take our time to enjoy it."::
45417::$$$message_0421_0000_0020$$$::"I agree. Let us soothe our fatigue for the battles to come."::

